OHQDy-ntPi7wrHUViFKvnczQhXpHAZ4wUkgmxAWQhDmY_fo8Mh_k7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftZOo2NBxqg5P-Xwe7IKiX7_adlQsefp0Bp5_qwUuswrQ&oe=69A1845A"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "510210628338938", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031359_510210631672271_3889054620789481961_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jZK463D1OZMQ7kNvwGYuMuB&_nc_oc=AdkMx1LTI2jszkKpZvcunRKSP0cYeqLLpFdyMpfHCFk-hrSzvS7LMcKTACp_0RhV2EU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft-Ds3PSFSkiGpUL-hUqbPcxZOWU4l7GjOldZQEygIDLA&oe=69A18AD3"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1241621836834075", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031652_1241621840167408_8711678203036836320_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wRA-69AkGowQ7kNvwGdKr-n&_nc_oc=AdkOnbmxSNU7s8wjJNntRXIF-ne_g_FNG9tDXTLiSA50Ea4eHlZZawNIJE3cfBlWKKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs0MbCMswJUw93CxAm0KAY0kzqvkkMy_5OIRdzKcNBTRA&oe=69A19FDF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod3_Title.png", "id": "3693715237561510", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036644_3693715240894843_8945723129178385145_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GAi2T4tKR20Q7kNvwF9pSe7&_nc_oc=Adm9O4ayWqhibXiy5x_7xN8vKzadiiPL0Roz_r_zPUEHGiwP3e2s5BBHDw_65I3s0Fo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfskhuoiLF1c8zS9ATZOINwUzcPQhaWIAH1gf2yDDCP29Q&oe=69A17F3E"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 3: Masonry Wood External", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing. Users are challenged to perform inspections with randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring all necessary procedures are followed.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning freestanding stoves and their common features.\n\n**Freestanding Stove Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "From the Future", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ftfvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "10431